$MDESC::Type = "DELTA FORCE";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Location: <f0> Korea" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Raining" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @

"\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1>, two elite infantry platoons, battle each other for control of a well protected bridge over a boulder strewn valley.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag to capture.  The flags are located in the open next to each base. The first team with <f1>Five points<f0> shall be the victor!" @

"\n\n<f1>Classified information: <f0> Overview compiled from aerial photographs, espionage and reconnaissance missions." @
"\n<f1>Item#1:<f0> Main base and tower house a majority of the artillery functions and power supplies. Unconfirmed reports of an intricate power grid enabling weapons, elevators, supply stations, and blast doors to be powered separately." @
"\n<f1>Item#2:<f0> Unconfirmed reports of minefields located in unprotected rear quarters of base perimeter." @
"\n<f1>Item#3:<f0> Bridge bunker power source appears to be independent from the main power grid." @
"\n<f1>Item#4:<f0> Perimeter bunkers may be boobietrapped.  Possibly containing miscellaneous weapons or supplies." @
"\n<f1>Item#5:<f0> Hard mounted weapons consist of 20mm Cannons, SAM emplacement, AAFlak Gun and a Howitzer, which may be operated manually and by remote command stations." @
"\n<f1>Item#6:<f0> Vehicle Depot, located near main base has the capability of producing a variety of ground based vehicles and aerial attack/transport units." @
"\n<f1>Item#7:<f0> Bridge objective appears to be protected by a 20mm cannon located in the vicinity on bridge bunker overlooking boulder populated valley." @
"\n<f1>Item#8:<f0> Unconfirmed sniper activity originating from boulder hill." @
"\n<f1>Item#9:<f0> Run. Because you can't fly.   :)" @ 

"\n\n<f0>--- For use with the <f1>DELTA FORCE TRIBES<f0> modification. ---" @
"\n<f1>Map Notes:<f0> DF_ReignDeath_v1.6  12/10/00.  Redesigned by:<f1> Thrax -THC- ODFC" @
"\n<f1>http://planetstarsiege.com/deltaforce/            <f0>email: <f1>thrax@whoever.com"; 